        "id": 1,
        "title": "Use case 1",
        "content": "## 1. Reducing AI Fatigue in Personal Finance Apps\n\n### Industry Context\nReal-world environment where the problem exists.\n\n### Problem Statement\n- Users face friction or inefficiency\n- Current systems are suboptimal\n- Business impact is measurable\n\n### User Persona\nA realistic user with goals and constraints.\n\n### Challenge for Participants\nDesign a GenAI-powered solution addressing the core issue.\n\n### Expected Solution Elements\n- AI-driven insights or automation\n- Improved UX flows\n- Better decision support\n\n### Deliverables\n- UI/UX Prototype\n- AI logic explanation\n- User journey\n- At least 3 KPIs\n\n### Success Metrics (KPIs)\n| KPI | Why it matters |\n|-----|--------------|\n| Example KPI | Measures success |\n\n### Constraints / Twist\n- Must consider real-world limitations\n- Avoid over-engineering\n"
      },
