    "description": "NEU Studio AI Challenge 2026 is our flagship innovation sprint designed to bring together the brightest minds across the organization to solve real-world problems using the power of Generative AI. This is not just a hackathon — it’s an opportunity to reimagine how we build, design, and deliver solutions in an AI-first world.\n\nParticipants will tackle carefully curated, real-world use cases across industries like Banking, Retail, Healthcare, Gaming, and more — combining UX thinking, business understanding, and cutting-edge AI to create meaningful, scalable solutions.\nIn this power-packed 3-week journey, teams will move from idea to prototype to working solution, competing across multiple rounds and showcasing their innovation to a distinguished panel of leaders.\n\nWhat’s in it for you?\n     - Build real, impactful GenAI solutions\n     - Gain visibility with senior leadership\n     - Collaborate in cross-functional teams\n     - Win exciting rewards, recognition, and more\nSo, are you ready to build the future with AI?",
